  abilityDesc: 19 combo Fire attack on all foes, 5 combo Fire attack on single foe
    (damage relative to remaining HP), raises normal hit amount for 3 turns, boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 3 turns, boosts critical damage for 3 turns
    & boosts own Atk for 3 turns
